# LuaSocket Library Files
# This folder contains the actual LuaSocket library files for fallback
# when Tacview doesn't include them (pre-1.9.0 versions)

# We DO commit the library files to provide a complete installation
# Users can use these files if their Tacview version doesn't include LuaSocket

# Keep all files
!socket.lua
!mime.lua
!*.dll
!*.so
!*.dylib

# Keep protocol modules
!socket/http.lua
!socket/smtp.lua
!socket/tp.lua
!socket/url.lua
!socket/ftp.lua

# Keep all documentation
!*.md
!README.md
!**/README.md

# Keep placeholders (for reference)
!*.placeholder

# Keep directory structure
!
